# Build __PLUGIN_NAME__

Run from `plugin-drafts/__PLUGIN_ID__/`:

```sh
bun build ./src/list_items.js --outfile actions/list_items.js --target bun
bun build ./src/save_item.js --outfile actions/save_item.js --target bun
bun build ./src/delete_item.js --outfile actions/delete_item.js --target bun
bun build ./src/ui.jsx --outfile ui/app.js --target browser
```

Build each new action the same way.
